WEBVTT

00:00:02.610 --> 00:00:05.590
Present Day

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:08.540
Present Time

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:23.290
And you don't seem to understand

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:28.490
A shame you seemed an honest man

00:00:26.740 --> 00:00:33.240
And all the fears you hold so dear

00:00:31.870 --> 00:00:38.510
Will turn to whisper in your ear

00:00:37.340 --> 00:00:41.910
And you know what they say might hurt you

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:44.380
And you know that it means so much

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:49.140
And you don't even feel a thing

00:00:47.840 --> 00:00:54.800
I am falling, I am fading

00:00:52.990 --> 00:00:58.920
I have lost it all

00:01:17.670 --> 00:01:26.940
I am falling, I am fading, I am drowning

00:01:25.390 --> 00:01:29.580
Help me to breathe

00:01:27.610 --> 00:01:34.790
I am hurting, I have lost it all

00:01:33.150 --> 00:01:37.330
I am losing

00:01:35.720 --> 00:01:41.530
Help me to breathe

00:02:42.350 --> 00:02:47.440
No, it's nothing as ambiguous as "memory"

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:48.840
Am I me?

00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:51.510
Lain is Lain

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:53.150
I wish you'd come here...

00:05:31.150 --> 00:05:34.650
I don't need to stay here.

00:06:13.210 --> 00:06:18.280
You'll have to excuse me. All this talking has worn me out.

00:06:31.020 --> 00:06:33.120
I've never seen one before!

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:41.360
Iwakura Lain. Are you and the Lain of the Wired one and the same?

00:06:41.360 --> 00:06:46.200
I've seen you before. In the Wired.

00:07:49.870 --> 00:07:52.500
Peeping Tom

00:08:18.020 --> 00:08:20.150
Come

00:08:43.570 --> 00:08:45.090
Poor Lain...

00:09:03.300 --> 00:09:07.330
Hey, I'm Lain, aren't I?

00:09:07.330 --> 00:09:08.530
No!

00:09:08.530 --> 00:09:10.050
No, you're not!

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:24.140
That's right, Lain. You're not needed in the real world.

00:09:24.140 --> 00:09:26.990
I'm committing suicide!

00:09:30.820 --> 00:09:33.830
Why? Why are you warm?

00:09:34.090 --> 00:09:38.160
Why do I have to feel the heat from your body?

00:10:17.060 --> 00:10:20.290
Yes. I'm God.

00:10:21.330 --> 00:10:23.480
How could you?

00:10:38.650 --> 00:10:43.520
Lain, you'd have more fun if you were a little more sociable.

00:10:56.970 --> 00:10:59.720
She's changed, all right.

00:11:05.010 --> 00:11:06.330
Are you okay?

00:11:08.210 --> 00:11:12.220
Lately... You've been slipping back to your old self, Lain.

00:11:12.220 --> 00:11:15.240
Are you okay? Lain, I...

00:11:18.360 --> 00:11:22.810
Lain, I'm sorry! It's all our fault! Are you okay, Lain?

00:11:32.810 --> 00:11:34.440
Glad to hear it.

00:12:28.300 --> 00:12:29.790
Are you tired?

00:12:32.030 --> 00:12:33.570
Yes.

00:12:34.100 --> 00:12:35.790
You're incredible...

00:12:36.510 --> 00:12:43.690
So, you've loaded an emulator of that Navi into your own brain.

00:12:44.110 --> 00:12:47.300
It's dangerous to subject yourself to that much information all at once.

00:12:47.300 --> 00:12:50.560
At your current capacity, you'll overflow.

00:12:55.660 --> 00:12:58.270
Am I a machine?

00:13:02.370 --> 00:13:06.520
Don't talk about me like I'm a machine.

00:13:07.840 --> 00:13:09.450
I didn't mean to.

00:13:11.410 --> 00:13:14.780
This is basically a software problem.

00:13:16.010 --> 00:13:19.750
Lain, you're software.

00:13:20.750 --> 00:13:23.070
You're not hardware.

00:13:24.050 --> 00:13:25.510
Software?

00:13:25.510 --> 00:13:29.790
Yes. An executable program with a body.

00:13:58.790 --> 00:14:00.430
Be quiet...

00:14:02.090 --> 00:14:03.440
Be quiet!

00:14:34.160 --> 00:14:35.320
Chisa!

00:14:40.560 --> 00:14:45.550
Chisa, we walked home together just once, right?

00:14:48.370 --> 00:14:53.710
I understand. I finally understand what you told me.

00:14:56.480 --> 00:14:57.660
Lain...

00:15:03.490 --> 00:15:06.540
It's easy to die, Lain.

00:15:07.760 --> 00:15:09.440
Right?

00:15:32.280 --> 00:15:37.070
There's nothing easy about dying.

00:15:39.090 --> 00:15:40.640
Sure it is!

00:15:41.590 --> 00:15:46.330
Lain, you already have a tool that will let you do it.

00:15:46.330 --> 00:15:47.780
What do you...

00:15:55.540 --> 00:15:58.080
The safety's already off.

00:15:58.080 --> 00:16:02.900
The trigger's heavy, so hold it with both hands and pull it with your thumb.

00:16:02.900 --> 00:16:04.430
A girl isn't strong enough.

00:16:08.720 --> 00:16:12.060
What, you still want to stay in the real world?

00:16:12.060 --> 00:16:16.230
Hey, that's not fair. You called me here, remember?

00:16:16.230 --> 00:16:18.460
I... I never...

00:16:18.460 --> 00:16:20.830
Bodies are meaningless.

00:16:20.830 --> 00:16:22.250
You're wrong.

00:16:23.070 --> 00:16:24.450
Lain.

00:16:31.640 --> 00:16:33.920
What is this?

00:16:40.850 --> 00:16:45.570
I thought that maybe we could meet after school and I could introduce you.

00:16:46.520 --> 00:16:49.480
This guy's pretty cute!

00:16:49.930 --> 00:16:53.020
And then those rumors about you and that teacher...

00:16:53.460 --> 00:16:58.570
I think if you get a boyfriend, everyone will know they're a lie.

00:16:58.570 --> 00:17:01.090
See you tomorrow. We'll talk about it then.

00:17:01.090 --> 00:17:02.180
'Bye!

00:17:11.280 --> 00:17:13.200
It's not a lie.

00:17:20.860 --> 00:17:22.820
W-Who's there?

00:17:30.300 --> 00:17:32.150
Who's there?!

00:17:43.350 --> 00:17:44.760
Lain?

00:17:48.050 --> 00:17:50.290
W-What?

00:17:50.290 --> 00:17:53.810
What's happened to you? You...

00:17:57.830 --> 00:18:01.850
It wasn't me.

00:18:03.930 --> 00:18:08.640
I never peeked at your secrets, Arisu,

00:18:08.640 --> 00:18:13.050
and I never sent those secrets out onto the Wired.

00:18:14.510 --> 00:18:19.060
It was you, Lain! I saw you!

00:18:19.780 --> 00:18:21.910
That isn't me.

00:18:21.910 --> 00:18:27.070
It looks like I'm not the only me. Some other me did it.

00:18:28.090 --> 00:18:29.760
What're you talking about?

00:18:30.530 --> 00:18:33.780
You might not be the only Arisu, either.

00:18:37.130 --> 00:18:42.250
But no matter how often I say I didn't do it, you'll believe that I did.

00:18:43.270 --> 00:18:46.300
So I'll make it so that it never happened.

00:18:47.040 --> 00:18:50.280
I've been working really hard to be able to do that.

00:18:53.150 --> 00:18:54.740
What do you mean?

00:18:54.740 --> 00:18:57.070
I don't need devices anymore.

00:18:57.070 --> 00:19:00.340
It looks like I've already destroyed the border

00:19:00.340 --> 00:19:01.970
between the Wired and the real world.

00:19:03.390 --> 00:19:07.030
I can go anyplace I want to now.

00:19:07.030 --> 00:19:09.280
So I came here.

00:19:10.100 --> 00:19:14.350
I should be able to undo something that happened!

00:19:15.140 --> 00:19:16.240
Lain...

00:19:31.190 --> 00:19:32.210
I...

00:19:34.390 --> 00:19:36.430
I'm scared...

00:19:36.430 --> 00:19:38.100
I'm scared!

00:19:54.780 --> 00:19:56.170
Arisu!

00:19:56.170 --> 00:19:57.770
Arisu! Good morning!

00:20:02.350 --> 00:20:03.240
Good morning.

00:20:03.240 --> 00:20:05.680
What's up, Arisu? Why are you depressed?

00:20:05.680 --> 00:20:08.080
Oh, is it that time of the month?

00:20:08.490 --> 00:20:10.480
Hey, you ever hear of"delicacy"?

00:20:10.480 --> 00:20:12.000
Come on, I was only...

00:20:12.800 --> 00:20:17.840
Juri, I don't think I can go through with it today.

00:20:17.840 --> 00:20:21.270
Huh? Go through with what?

00:20:21.270 --> 00:20:24.450
What? Didn't you send me a CU-mail yesterday?

00:20:25.310 --> 00:20:27.840
No, I didn't send you anything yesterday.

00:20:27.840 --> 00:20:30.520
You're sure acting strange today, Arisu.

00:20:35.490 --> 00:20:36.970
Arisu!

00:20:38.690 --> 00:20:41.780
Oh, that teacher... He sure is hot!

00:20:41.780 --> 00:20:46.980
Yeah! But rumor has it that he's seeing an 8th-grader!

00:20:46.980 --> 00:20:49.880
What, are you serious? That's gross!

00:20:50.900 --> 00:20:53.920
Um... Listen, I...

00:20:54.340 --> 00:20:55.770
What is it?

00:20:55.770 --> 00:21:00.490
A-About that teacher... and me...

00:21:02.180 --> 00:21:04.670
Is there something between that teacher and you?

00:21:04.670 --> 00:21:06.940
Do you like him or something?

00:21:07.380 --> 00:21:09.440
Sorry, you're too late!

00:21:09.440 --> 00:21:12.020
Yeah! He already has a girlfriend.

00:21:12.020 --> 00:21:13.910
That's not like you, Arisu.

00:21:13.910 --> 00:21:16.540
Yeah, she sure is acting strange today.

00:21:47.020 --> 00:21:49.560
Lain! Good morning!

00:21:49.560 --> 00:21:50.770
Hurry it up!

00:21:51.110 --> 00:21:53.010
Come on, Lain!

00:21:53.760 --> 00:21:54.910
Lain!

00:22:01.870 --> 00:22:04.520
Lain, you...

00:22:10.280 --> 00:22:14.030
Lain, you smiled...

00:22:32.610 --> 00:22:37.040
nan no tsumi mo nai hazu na no ni

00:22:32.610 --> 00:22:37.040
Although I must be innocent,

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:40.950
nanraka no batsu wo uketeru

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:40.950
now I am punished.

00:22:41.380 --> 00:22:47.250
jibun de maita tane de mo nai no ni

00:22:41.380 --> 00:22:47.250
I wasn't the one who sowed those seeds, but nevertheless

00:22:47.970 --> 00:22:54.160
sakimidareta hana tsumasareru

00:22:47.970 --> 00:22:54.160
I have to pull up the flowers that bloomed from them.

00:23:00.710 --> 00:23:05.350
shiranai koto to mo ienai ga

00:23:00.710 --> 00:23:05.350
I can't say I didn't know about it,

00:23:05.350 --> 00:23:09.800
katabou katsuida oboe wa nai

00:23:05.350 --> 00:23:09.800
but I don't remember taking any part in it.

00:23:09.800 --> 00:23:15.990
jiyuu wo takaku kawasareta ki mo suru ga

00:23:09.800 --> 00:23:15.990
I think my freedom cost me dearly,

00:23:16.520 --> 00:23:23.230
kokoro made yasuku utta oboe wa nai

00:23:16.520 --> 00:23:23.230
but I don't remember selling my soul so cheaply.

00:23:23.590 --> 00:23:31.280
Hey Hey kutabatte osaraba suru made

00:23:23.590 --> 00:23:31.280
Hey hey, until I die and say farewell...

00:23:32.300 --> 00:23:41.190
Hey Hey dare no te ni mo kakaranai

00:23:32.300 --> 00:23:41.190
Hey hey... no one can touch me.

00:23:42.710 --> 00:23:46.800
tooi yoru wo urotsuiteiru

00:23:42.710 --> 00:23:46.800
You probably don't know

00:23:46.800 --> 00:23:54.510
shiranai darou eien no narazu monotachi wo

00:23:46.800 --> 00:23:54.510
the eternal outlaws prowling in the distant night.
